{"id":"vod_sn_37058","vodId":"37058","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"野球少年","name_cn":"野球少年","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/d38be2becd6df0687268b3d14b41345e.jpg"},"summary":"原田巧（内山昂辉 配音）似乎生来就要成为一名投手，在棒球运动上有着极大天赋的他一路走来收获了无数的赞美和荣誉。升入初中后，巧来到了风景秀丽民风淳朴的新田市，在那里，他即将开始初中生活。一次偶然中，一个名为永仓豪（畠中祐 配音）的男生，竟然接住了巧拼尽全力投出的球。两人的相遇让命运的齿轮开始了转动。　　巧和豪双双加入了新田东中学棒球部，在那里认识了许多志同道合的朋友们——沉默寡言的队长海音寺一希（梅原裕一郎 配音）、温柔体贴的泽口文人（村濑步 配音）、自信满满的吉贞伸弘（齐藤壮马 配音）、不苟言笑的展西咏司（森岛秀太 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:48:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZJUNz2sP601/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NMXtTgcwdb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H2bEp7wEkr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EumGJnJrFD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RyudFEJ0XE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wqjzcDjiYa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CnMJmcr6Jb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/a4C4Xj1B211/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BxVjgxhGeV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xWhhx5N2mG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jrzz1EJ3p21/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:15.685Z"}